exports[`S5 Move (en) > normal: the library verbatim, the 14-day rule, contract and identity 1`] = `"<div data-testid="layout"><div data-testid="insights-move" data-cp-shell="" class="cp bg-cp-ground text-cp-ink  "><div class="lg:ps-[240px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[640px] lg:px-16 lg:pt-9 lg:max-w-[848px]"><div class=" pb-4 md:max-lg:pb-[calc(80px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] lg:pb-16"><div class="min-w-0"><header data-testid="insights-appbar" class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-cp-hairline bg-cp-surface px-5 pb-3 pt-4 lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:px-0 lg:pb-4 lg:pt-0"><a aria-label="Back" class="mt-0.5 flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-cp-hairline bg-white text-cp-navy outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left rtl:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-[13px] leading-snug text-cp-ink-3"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">I-IP-TIME-1</span> from the library</div><h1 class="break-words text-[24px] font-extrabold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy [overflow-wrap:anywhere] lg:text-[30px]"><span data-text="library">Hard cap: explanation ends at minute 10 (rehearse the stop line)</span></h1><div class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink-3"><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">28 Sep to 25 Oct · lesson-plan fidelity · scoring changed 28 Sep</p></div></div></header><div class="cp-enter flex flex-col px-5 pt-4 lg:px-0 lg:pt-2"><section data-testid="s5-w" class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-1"><p class="cp-eyebrow text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-green-ink ">ONE MOVE</p><p class="text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink"><span data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[22px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy">17 of 49</span> lessons whose plan asked for independent practice ran out of time before the practice.</p></section><section data-testid="s5-step" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">The teacher's one step</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p data-text="library" class="text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink">Write 10 in the board corner; stop explaining at minute 10 and move to 'we do'</p></div></div></section><section data-testid="s5-try-tomorrow" data-surface="" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] bg-cp-surface p-5 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(51,55,72,0.08)] lg:p-7  mt-5"><p class="text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.45] text-cp-navy"><span data-text="library">Try this tomorrow: write 10 in the board corner before you start, and at minute 10 say the stop line and move to 'we do', even if you have not finished.</span></p></section><section data-testid="s5-rehearsal" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3"><span data-nonum="">Rehearsal, 30 seconds</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink" data-nonum="">Rehearsal, 30 seconds. The teacher says it as it will be said to the class: <span data-text="library">The teacher says the stop line as to the class: «بس، وضاحت یہیں ختم۔ اب ایک سوال مل کر کرتے ہیں۔» (that is enough explaining; now one question together). Three times, each time the coach says a minute number first ('nine... ten... stop'). The coach listens for the line coming out without an extra explanation attached.</span></p><a data-testid="s5-play" class="cp-press inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-navy focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 border-2 border-cp-navy bg-white text-cp-navy min-h-[44px] rounded-[12px] px-4 text-[14px] font-semibold  self-start" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME#moment"><span>Play the moment in the debrief</span></a></div></div></section><section data-testid="s5-facts" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">With whom</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink">One teacher, in the debrief after a recording that fired W-IP-TIME.</p><h2 class="pt-1 cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">How long</h2><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink">5 min inside a 15 min debrief</p></div></div></section><section data-testid="s5-materials" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">Materials</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-cp-hairline"><li data-kind="print" class="py-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><span data-text="library">Timekeeper card: the board corner shows 10 / 17 / 25; a child says "time khatam" at each mark</span></li><li data-kind="other" class="py-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><span data-text="library">NIETE next-step line "manage": One signal for attention and one routine for switching tasks, used every time</span></li><li data-kind="vidrec" class="py-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><span data-text="library">VIDREC module 47 "Five step lesson plan"</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section data-testid="s5-listen-for" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">What you listen for</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink">The explanation stops by about minute 10 with a sentence like «بس، اتنا کافی ہے، اب مل کر کرتے ہیں» and a guided item follows; the practice stretch and the exit are then both present.</p></div></div></section><section data-testid="s5-check" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">Check it worked</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink">The number 10 was on the board and the teacher moved to 'we do' by minute 11 in the lesson the coach watched.</p><p data-testid="s5-check-rule" data-nonum="" class="border-t border-cp-hairline pt-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">No visit is booked within 14 days, so the check is <span data-date="2026-11-09">Mon 9 Nov</span>, 14 days after the step is set.</p></div></div></section><details data-testid="s5-evidence" class="group mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-3"><summary class="flex min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">Why this works</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right shrink-0 text-cp-ink-3 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 rtl:rotate-180 rtl:group-open:rotate-90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 pb-1 pt-2"><li class="text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><p data-text="library" class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-cp-ink-2">Rosenshine, B. (2012). Principles of Instruction. American Educator 36(1)</p><p data-text="library">small amounts of material at a time, then guided practice; the FLN plans put 10 minutes on practice, so the explanation cannot run past a third of the period</p></li></ul></details><section data-testid="s5-alternatives" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">Other moves</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-cp-hairline"><li data-i="I-IP-1" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center py-2.5 text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><span data-text="library">Coach models the practice step in the teacher's class</span></li><li data-i="I-IP-TIME-2" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center py-2.5 text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-cp-ink"><span data-text="library">A child timekeeper and the three marks on the board</span></li></ul></div></div></section><p data-testid="s5-footer" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-4 text-center text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">Written to your tracker, never to a file on the teacher.</p><div class="lg:hidden"><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-6 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">Codes, never names. For coaching, never for evaluation.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

